      "title": "bacapp: Fix crash when formatting called from print_packet",
      "message": "bacapp: Fix crash when formatting called from print_packet\n\nCustom format functions can be called when wmem_packet_scope is\nnot in scope, e.g., from print_packet() in tshark. At that point,\npinfo->pool is still in scope be the format functions don't have\naccess to it. So we can't call the non const version of val_to_str.\n\nFixup dae788a0c1f740098feb96c83aafd40e3b910db9\nFix #20662\n",
